  "id": "aging",
  "term": "aging",
  "definition": "Aging is the later-life process in which people’s abilities and opportunities change over time, leading them to adjust goals, sense of control, and what feels emotionally important. In psychology and social contexts, healthy aging is understood as functional ability shaped by both a person’s own capacities and the supportiveness of their environment.",
